# Cloud target — used ONLY by `npm run db:migrate:cloud`.
# Copy to .env.cloud.local and paste the real connection string.
#
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → Database → Connection string → URI
# Use the "Session pooler" URI (IPv4-safe). It looks like:
#   postgresql://postgres.jwlxcanbgwipkzttxnkb:<PASSWORD>@aws-0-ap-northeast-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
#
# This file is gitignored. Keep the password in your password manager too.
